<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ titles.review }} {{ date }}</title>
<style>
  body{margin:0;background:#f3f4f6;font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111827;line-height:1.5}
  .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px}
  h1{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 4px} h2{font-size:15px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#4b5563;margin:28px 0 10px}
  .meta{color:#6b7280;font-size:13px}
  .scroll{overflow-x:auto}
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px}
  th,td{text-align:left;padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;vertical-align:top}
  th{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:#4b5563;background:#f9fafb}
  td.num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
  td.nowrap{white-space:nowrap}
  .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:#e5e7eb;color:#374151;white-space:nowrap}
  .badge.act{background:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b}.badge.signal{background:#dbeafe;color:#1e40af}.badge.filtered{background:#f3f4f6;color:#6b7280}
  .small{font-size:12px;color:#6b7280}
  a{color:#1d4ed8}
  .warn{background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#92400e;margin-top:12px}
  .empty{color:#6b7280;font-style:italic}
  .neg{color:#b91c1c}
  .terms{font-size:11px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:2px}
</style>
</head>
<body><div class="wrap">
<h1>{{ titles.review }}</h1>
<div class="meta">{{ generated }} &middot; last {{ days }} day(s) &middot; {{ rows|length }} item(s){% if filters %} &middot; {{ filters }}{% endif %}</div>
{% if limit_reached %}<div class="warn">Limit of {{ rows|length }} items reached; narrow the filters or raise --limit.</div>{% endif %}

{% if rows %}
<h2>Per source</h2>
<p class="small">Quiet score (limits.min_score) is {{ min_score }}. A source with many <i>filtered</i> items and a low average is mostly noise; one with briefed items but a low average may need more trust or keywords.</p>
<div class="scroll"><table>
<tr><th>Source</th>{% for st in statuses %}<th class="num">{{ st }}</th>{% endfor %}<th class="num">Total</th><th class="num">Avg score</th></tr>
{% for s in by_source %}
<tr><td class="nowrap">{{ s.source }}</td>{% for st in statuses %}<td class="num">{{ s[st] or '' }}</td>{% endfor %}<td class="num">{{ s.total }}</td><td class="num">{{ s.avg_score }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
<tr><th>All</th>{% for st in statuses %}<th class="num">{{ status_totals[st] }}</th>{% endfor %}<th class="num">{{ rows|length }}</th><th></th></tr>
</table></div>

<h2>Keyword hits</h2>
{% if top_terms %}
<p class="small">How often each gating.yaml term matched (top 40), and how many of those items were briefed. Terms that hit often but are never briefed are candidates for a lower weight or the noise group; negative (noise) terms start with "-".</p>
<div class="scroll"><table>
<tr><th>Term</th><th class="num">Hits</th><th class="num">Briefed</th></tr>
{% for t in top_terms %}<tr><td{% if t.term.startswith('-') %} class="neg"{% endif %}>{{ t.term }}</td><td class="num">{{ t.hits }}</td><td class="num">{{ t.briefed }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
</table></div>
{% endif %}
{% if with_terms < rows|length %}<p class="small">{{ rows|length - with_terms }} item(s) were stored before keyword tracking was added; their terms are unknown.</p>{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% for day, items in by_day %}
<h2>{{ day }} ({{ items|length }})</h2>
<div class="scroll"><table>
<tr><th>Time</th><th>Status</th><th>Score</th><th>Source</th><th>Title</th></tr>
{% for r in items %}
<tr>
  <td class="nowrap">{{ r.time }}</td>
  <td><span class="badge {{ r.kind or r.status }}">{{ r.label }}</span></td>
  <td class="num">{{ '%.1f'|format(r.score or 0) }}</td>
  <td class="nowrap">{{ r.source_id }}</td>
  <td><a href="{{ r.link }}">{{ r.title }}</a>
    {% if r.headline and r.headline != r.title %}<div class="small">Brief: {{ r.headline }}</div>{% endif %}
    {% if r.terms %}<div class="terms">{{ r.terms|join(', ') }}</div>{% endif %}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</table></div>
{% else %}<p class="empty">No items match these filters.</p>{% endfor %}
</div></body></html>
